data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1580, "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "data": {"id": "bf9e5ffa-485d-4e0c-bade-1317910b235e", "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "kind": "tool", "position": 1578, "revision": 1580, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"name": "Read", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"[workspace]\"}", "status": "running", "tool_use_id": "call_7b545d5134a84ef5aa8fe70f"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:47:32.806592+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:47:33.312603+00:00"}}

id: 1582
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1582, "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "data": {"id": "bf9e5ffa-485d-4e0c-bade-1317910b235e", "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "kind": "tool", "position": 1578, "revision": 1582, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"name": "Read", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"[workspace]\"}", "output": "1\t# Reproduction Guide\n2\t\n3\t## How to Reproduce the Analysis\n4\t\n5\tAll scripts must be run from the project root directory. The `data/` directory must remain unmodified.\n6\t\n7\t### Prerequisites\n8\t- Python 3.11+\n9\t- pandas, numpy, scipy\n10\t\n11\t### Step-by-step\n12\t\n13\t```bash\n14\tcd [workspace]\n15\t\n16\t# Step 1: Explore data structure\n17\tpython3 output/analysis_01_explore_data.py\n18\t\n19\t# Step 2: Run core statistical analysis (produces output/analysis_summary.json)\n20\tpython3 output/analysis_02_core_findings.py\n21\t\n22\t# Step 3: Generate figure CSVs and cross-comparisons (produces output/fig*.csv, output/analysis_results.json)\n23\tpython3 output/analysis_03_figures.py\n24\t\n25\t# Step 4: Deep angle-resolved and robustness analysis (produces output/deep_analysis_results.json)\n26\tpython3 output/analysis_04_deep.py\n27\t\n28\t# Step 5: CORRECTED energy-grid alignment with interpolation and perturbation\n29\tpython3 output/analysis_fix_energy_alignment.py\n30\t\n31\t# Step 6: Round 3 corrected angle-resolved analysis on spline-aligned grids\n32\tpython3 output/analysis_round3_angle_resolved.py\n33\t\n34\t# Step 7: Independent replication (sub-agent code restored for reproducibility)\n35\tpython3 output/independent_dme_agent.py\n36\tpython3 output/independent_angular_coeff_agent.py\n37\tpython3 output/independent_wigner_agent.py\n38\t```\n39\t\n40\t### Expected outputs in `output/`\n41\t| File | Description |\n42\t|------|-------------|\n43\t| `Result.md` | Authoritative findings report (4 registered findings) |\n44\t| `fig1_aligned_phase_diff.csv` | Per-energy phase difference (spline-aligned) |\n45\t| `fig1_exp_theory_phase_diff.csv` | Per-energy phase difference (old flawed version) |\n46\t| `fig1_angle_resolved_aligned.csv` | Angle-resolved phase diff (spline-aligned, Round 3) |\n47\t| `fig2_angular_coefficients.csv` | Order-0 Legendre coefficients at 13 energies |\n48\t| `fig2_order1_angular_coefficients.csv` | Order-1 Legendre coefficients at 13 energies |\n49\t| `fig3_dme_magnitude.csv` | DME magnitude statistics at 13 energies |\n50\t| `fig4_wigner_delay.csv` | Full Wigner delay curve (296 points) |\n51\t| `fig4_angle_averaged_delay.csv` | Angle-averaged delay curve (200 points) |\n52\t| `fig4_eigenphase_sum.csv` | Eigenphase sum curve (50 points) |\n53\t| `aligned_exp_theory_comparison.json` | Grid characterization, old-alignment diagnosis, perturbation analysis |\n54\t| `analysis_results.json` | Summary statistics (superseded by aligned version) |\n55\t| `deep_analysis_results.json` | Angle-resolved and LOO robustness results |\n56\t| `independent_dme_results.json` | Independent sub-agent DME replication |\n57\t| `independent_angular_coeff_results.json` | Independent sub-agent angular coefficient replication |\n58\t| `independent_wigner_results.json` | Independent sub-agent Wigner delay replication |\n59\t\n60\t### Validation\n61\tRun the validation script:\n62\t```bash\n63\tpython3 validate_output.py output\n64\t```\n65\t", "status": "completed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_7b545d5134a84ef5aa8fe70f"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:47:32.806592+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:47:33.427857+00:00"}}

