L     reproduced file missing: fig1_aligned_phase_diff.csv\nPhase diff (old index-alignment)              FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig1_exp_theory_phase_diff.csv\nAngle-resolved phase diff                     FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig1_angle_resolved_aligned.csv\nOrder-0 angular coefficients                  FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig2_angular_coefficients.csv\nOrder-1 angular coefficients                  FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig2_order1_angular_coefficients.csv\nDME magnitude statistics                      FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig3_dme_magnitude.csv\nWigner delay curve                            FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig4_wigner_delay.csv\nAngle-averaged delay                          FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig4_angle_averaged_delay.csv\nEigenphase sum                                FAIL     reproduced file missing: fig4_eigenphase_sum.csv\nGrid characterization & perturbation          FAIL     reproduced file missing: aligned_exp_theory_comparison.json\nSummary statistics                            FAIL     reproduced file missing: analysis_results.json\nDeep analysis results                         FAIL     reproduced file missing: deep_analysis_results.json\nIndependent DME results                       FAIL     reproduced file missing: independent_dme_results.json\nIndependent angular coeff results             FAIL     reproduced file missing: independent_angular_coeff_results.json\nIndependent Wigner results                    FAIL     reproduced file missing: independent_wigner_results.json\n\nSummary: 0 PASS, 0 WARN, 15 FAIL, 0 ERROR, 0 SKIP out of 15 files\n\nComparison saved to reproduce_test/comparison_results.json", "status": "completed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_592c539f4085458280351fd2"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:48:06.919880+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:49:45.752686+00:00"}}

