data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1724, "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "data": {"id": "88577149-370c-4574-93b2-f50908d6df80", "run_id": "run_39688b3495bc4b32", "kind": "text", "position": 1722, "revision": 1724, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All done. Summary of Round 4 completion:\n\n**Skill completion standard #6 — Clean-directory reproduction:**\n\n1. Created `reproduce_test/` as a clean target directory (no prior outputs).\n2. Ran all 9 analysis scripts from raw `data/` input into the clean directory via `working/reproduce_clean_v2.py`.\n3. Compared all 15 core artifacts (CSV + JSON) against authoritative `output/` versions with 1e-6 tolerance. **Result: 15/15 PASS**, max absolute difference = 0.00e+00 for every file.\n4. Documented in Result.md's Reproducibility section: tolerance rationale, full comparison table, and reference to `reproduce_test/comparison_results.json`.\n5. Updated analysis-state.md with Round 4 verification status.\n6. Validator passes: 4 findings, 0 errors, 0 warnings."}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:53:08.866729+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:53:09.275266+00:00"}}

